Product Video includes a directory of public text-to-speech voice identifiers,
display names, language labels, and routing metadata in:

  scripts/engine/product_video/data/voices.json
  scripts/engine/examples/voices.csv

Source: Volcengine public voice catalog
https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/6561/1257544?lang=zh

Snapshot retrieved on 2026-09-09; source update date: 2026-08-31.
The catalog does not contain voice models, recordings, or account credentials.
Listing a voice does not grant permission to use the voice service. Access and
usage are governed by the provider and the user's account permissions.

Third-party Python dependencies, Chromium, FFmpeg, and system fonts are not
vendored in this repository and remain under their respective licenses.
The introductory video in docs/assets is a generated product demonstration,
not a redistributable voice sample library.
